{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1216,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5b281072e8a1b25ee889fb4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然我……提不起力气！\r\n但这种状态下要是赢了，就特别帅啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f2f8d0108095adae15930321468da7901dfd055098ee3491f64e3625e461bf80",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e710c4da64afbad01956ff2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽不能说是准备万全……\r\n但不跑到最后是不会知道结果的。\r\n这就是比赛的乐趣！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4928c442da1c0f0c1df8e2f8b019b1447ff615d9bfaf4c01d3edb00d69ec937f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4dce3d691cc5e688db0a3477",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就算状态不好……我也会赢的。\r\n开始前就觉得自己会输的话，\r\n原本能赢的比赛也要输掉了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd8db24507f662a78354c80ba13e031f444d92424bd5061f4a72945018480388",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81d0de8e56e2846144717233",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "可恶！身体好沉重啊……\r\n但我是不会放弃的。\r\n努力挣扎到最后才是我的风格！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d119c152efe2179dc1519cb21b57a23103a36fef105eb304c71b3d024220865d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0bde49f882c440c065f797b1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即使有所不安，我也只能\r\n继续向前奔跑……因为我可是\r\n继承了骑士之魂的人啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea49612c9730484e67bc9dc958de2ce0bae98f3c6d94e0c34f937e2edfd0d91c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e89682796bb57c8d6436ab28",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……我现在的状态的确糟透了。\r\n但承担的风险越高就越刺激，\r\n也会让我感到更加热血……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b82feaa0e0566d0612811d47038a4f569c827e4908d28446742ed3a7d7644a12",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54f8614c4fcea431b624f678",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要上咯ー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab8bb0a79ddfb24cfe9e885b7256c9fe4d69c7801d7de255f9787662c4e2267f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0468e9218b3e424c1f998a4d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "156457bc54ba27ebeaab1aba3aaf9a68ceea61cd9f05dfb3deffdb2be3ad073e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "20039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c909630f402c6bd8d8340f60",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "交给我吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "abd39c284289b19c8944436e7ca3b6b2ead589d70912da6f1ecd3665819f7367",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "20040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf5121cadf0dbe3c0fae4dbe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是学习么～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "19381fe72b31415b6c0f25f2dcbd73caaa9ed67b16e6a502f8e576807105470f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "20041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a6da9e5d264229eed97de1ae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "可恶。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e6a175df6c23bb59e055c29fae4828b796c899766d0194dab1d5d8317a3a008",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "20042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:34c03ec9cb03ec6027d8402e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我不懂啊ー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "15ce617e0cd5498474461896f15f143e28894fed7da5caffc16814d491981fc3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "20043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1f38724fc1359b8e964d598",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好！走吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "94a65df2f9e8cedc8b2b3c79335a16547098897e908e544df9f9d284f4fef8b3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "20046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c0a8b0f6d36e07f85ccff13",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来去吹吹海风吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e75b74a5e7baeb296088844f888c558531d030495c52fa2c1956f1252572fef1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "20047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae32efd7c6929d3c5937e0dd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，这都是你的功劳啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "49aba948ddaae56ed9fa66ed6d10bc72a3a8fc6518ae82613620579576366715",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "20049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c923954887b1ac89e8cf468",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要好好向你道谢呢！Thank You！",
      "source_fingerprint": "14d0de1ccfa0bbd9f9e084b9229a97453c87be85202e83e4ea86a0f6adb55b6d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "20050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f529fa592d2e5a09946b88b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好啊，那就来开始吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c186004bd9392c5a885a675b76708ecc3f3276a29f6aaae2bac9f640ee8ab023",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ecf236107af8d0aeaeaf4d7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "走吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "92ae3e5dcae9a53056d19b3106de1996e8c400c410dfd1c96cb651012cfebc4c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "2030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a34ff1c305393e9d8a5b46a2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好啊，打起精神去做吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ce4e9c414bac12c827d0c6817492bb1bae3dfd925a4b542637e7431c4d4ec4d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "2031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b2088b918e8795015941905",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要好好向你道谢呢！Thank You！",
      "source_fingerprint": "14d0de1ccfa0bbd9f9e084b9229a97453c87be85202e83e4ea86a0f6adb55b6d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "2032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:687da28cfcb65b97cf11f2bb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "脚好轻盈啊……嘿嘿！\r\n你好好期待比赛的结果吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "361236ee6aeb9c40eb61137e168bed67dfcb1714fa2a724ad7530e94b1a0b7b0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "2033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:16c48aca4552f2473259f822",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好啊～！！\r\n我的血液也在轰隆隆地沸腾～！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e42eb38f25838caf33f33a6fc23f727efbabc7dca6e12cc7030f61c72c233dca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "2034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bad664929148c39cf76b9d29",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要好好向你道谢呢！Thank You！",
      "source_fingerprint": "14d0de1ccfa0bbd9f9e084b9229a97453c87be85202e83e4ea86a0f6adb55b6d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "2035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95656bf48e6f16a8290ff607",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "任せろ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "98eedc2a1e4cadc1f6e6bd8d04e68a29a670522868b9138650e5be5d6098cef0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "23015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38615a0e51127c255a837493",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次第一名的人会是我ーー！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "48c51e689335d7ebdc6d33710565bc020c6ba8a85c388eb4d5f56d9780ede5d9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "30000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:767cf8b8dcd15ef0f4b8f969",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要越过的墙越高，就越让我感到热血！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f50994a11875bc3d5a6f41b328e41f9bfb1d545a58af10eddfe61ff0ed5a56e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53398a1c44d9791ba7f03769",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我还想继续进攻来着。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ccbf23d87446ded6dfac54f8f4aae7c44ab55beb66159515f919ad8d965a5a7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:22b028a5471fcd9b36b53601",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我这也太逊了吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "64e0e89b03a58d350e766a3fa5d1494a63f937e2e4c50b49a8117860e4ad2681",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c7d8dc4ac92ad1103b4d8fe3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "咕噜……噗哈！……成功啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8df9a171d883453c66bb55cc8f616e16fa12b6eecbb4e4b6ffdb136f7eb60e82",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:032f34544908638401f30c60",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼……是我……赢了吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c0722ec0dad7cba413021dbe1d07a1b9d749fbe8f19a5f3bea43d649d778eac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50609953861e85d2651ecedf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "久等啦！火速为你送上胜利大礼！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9fc82aed114b13d23e3638d2f6f792dc532e875388c1da0ba38fe8fbbf623ba7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "30006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:23b31c644fcf94788dbb0937",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼……是我……赢了吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c0722ec0dad7cba413021dbe1d07a1b9d749fbe8f19a5f3bea43d649d778eac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "30007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2cedd04bc572f5b4c303e7e4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要上了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fbdea77b33aeaec916717deb674c10b49445b607aad8c9a51a8f916ddb616c89",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8466b2f1af120d276d023a1c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我……我会把……油门踩到底的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1871834deb5fa713143db1f675397fb38ba2c6c93c42ba8b15c85281a6c04738",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a66b8de0c6550aa693064cfa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唉～真提不起劲。\r\n我已经不能嘲笑她睡乱的头发，\r\n也没人帮我整理制服的蝴蝶结了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "4035112375fa9ab7cbcba5dab9962703b017c44ac5073b9a40223af9c88d7eda",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "400003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c082a8b744f892a9bca41bd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天就别自主训练，去看机车吧！\r\n我本来是这么想……\r\n可是总觉得心情不怎么兴奋……",
      "source_fingerprint": "d757a35479a7d646d99f5d31d22bb226f66239c86f40e457aec7f30a7174ab79",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "400004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b2b06c1c4d440cb9555da5e7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "或许啊……\r\n所谓的帅气，取决于面对危机当下\r\n所做出的行动呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "35c3df540e73e69138947af3ee20729aa5efaba929ab0dd319dd8aaf113b252e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "400006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c3b74eeca22cc2f6cee15e61",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "机会难得，帮你选个圣诞节礼物吧。\r\n……只是顺便啦，\r\n我刚好也要买礼物……",
      "source_fingerprint": "b63183370e0d521a48969134df4a1ca15fdace148a17dc41abdbeb37db71c678",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "400009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14672ba3ca1e63f816e60d2e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我……我会把……油门踩到底的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1871834deb5fa713143db1f675397fb38ba2c6c93c42ba8b15c85281a6c04738",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e18ec2a0899e9a9540918f4b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动任务也有很多丰富内容喔！\r\n感觉会是一场热闹的典礼呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "bde9c1c9d14b827562de6047d9cdd81bca387fd84e5b090e48858f613f6f9a2d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "400012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:048ad160978a7a7e6de0827c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "拿去！这是「婚宴小礼」！\r\n……开玩笑的啦！\r\n你可别忘了拿啰！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6883b742b28ded313de867de36519e08db20155046476f1708bbe9a60bc1b23",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "400013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:039fe1652301c7a09a7b79ec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让大家见识一下！",
      "source_fingerprint": "97995958e9c91ee3d133d27520a769a8c36ef2cf209a40a9cb8228ab4bf83de8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "40002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bea57aae5aa640ca36709fd9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喝啊，看招！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6322de14f539ff35d5e7e201fd428eedd146c810417f22a88bb5b74929f6d532",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "40003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6304f6a18edece5eb0a9fe96",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呀呵～！仔细看着我的技术吧！\r\n我用最快速度抵达了……礼物来啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e8e0160f28f01bdb2095228d4bfde69feb3327c40d0cc22dc23690ae0dcba29",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "40004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dbdfd88f7dcbc692babf77bf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我上了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "004e7ad03760ca4de54eb8714ebf3d626f0737fd957dec00e92601dd4fdc23ea",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "410000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f890c619f1475219f3131f55",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "成功了～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d1bf314e1f144b611c7778e151a34ecc1b19a98f8d54f3b64e99198cd19a5b5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "410001"
      ]
    },
